{"version":1,"key":"card:476","content":{"id":476,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7ca1da2e-f126-41a9-93d3-7a687019dffe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模块包含哪些东西，可使用函数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它列出对象的所有属性"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"8d64450e-5b5a-4171-ac69-760be282d5c6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8d22ae93-b035-43e3-8fbc-28a67a87bc67","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> import copy\n>>> dir(copy)\n['Error', '__all__', '__builtins__', '__cached__', '__doc__', '__file__', '__loader__', '__name__', '__package__', '__spec__', '_copy_dispatch', '_copy_immutable', '_deepcopy_atomic', '_deepcopy_dict', '_deepcopy_dispatch', '_deepcopy_list', '_deepcopy_method', '_deepcopy_tuple', '_keep_alive', '_reconstruct', 'copy', 'deepcopy', 'dispatch_table', 'error']\n>>> [n for n in dir(copy) if not n.startswith('_')]\n['Error', 'copy', 'deepcopy', 'dispatch_table', 'error']","collabId":"bc87f430-9078-4393-9533-b0a0418da0f9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3c413a55-6144-466a-99e4-3d4085679755","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__all__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包含一个列表，定义模块的公有接口。具体地说，它告诉解释器从这个模块可导入的名称有哪些"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"085c025a-43d3-41e5-8e16-731383b16ca2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"68e960ea-ec36-4efe-9389-9231aa3d45d7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> copy.__all__\n['Error', 'copy', 'deepcopy']","collabId":"0081b518-b84e-4cdf-9d18-5eff310f1e63","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e94c488c-596e-4830-bcc0-838bf0ce0154","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"from copy import *"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 只能得到变量 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__all__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中列出的三个函数。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"cadfd6a1-aa5a-42a0-8cab-576dfe2ca27f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"73af8a2a-3e77-4e4e-8aeb-cc7f79547ae4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__all__"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则会在以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"import *"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方式导入时，导入所有不以下划线打头的全局名称。"}]}]}],"tags":["Python/模块"],"createTime":1719364729103,"updateTime":1791474923036,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923036}}